  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a7XhiK6.png\"><br></span><hr><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:24px\">關於：</span></span><br></span>「傀儡重製版」（原名「優質傀儡」）是一款針對最新 Minecraft 版本打造的資源包，旨在以嶄新的設計與更多額外功能全面翻新遊戲中的鐵傀儡。<br>鐵傀儡共有 26 種全新變體，可於各種生物群系中生成，或透過命名牌召喚。<br><br></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:24px\">注意：</span></span><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:16px\">雖然 OptiFine 是使用 CEM 資源包較受歡迎的方式，但我個人建議使用 Entity Model Features。</span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#bdc3c7\">下載適用於 Forge/Fabric 的 Entity Model Features，請<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">點擊此處。</span></a><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">許多生物群系變體傀儡的靈感來自於 Instagram 上 Seth Pennigton 的作品；<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fseth_pennington_%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">歡迎前往查看！</a></span></span><br><br>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">-木傀儡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">-鵝卵石傀儡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">-樹脂傀儡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">-煤炭傀儡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">-青金石傀儡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">-紅石傀儡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">-金傀儡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">-綠寶石傀儡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">-鑽石傀儡</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">-下界合金傀儡</span></p>\n</div>\n<br><br><br><br><br><br><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CRlFw8K.png\"><br></span></div>",
